<mxCell id="dwall-t1" value="&lt;b&gt;HBO Max - Data Warehouse physical model (UML database notation)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fact constellation: 5 fact tables (orange) share 10 conformed dimensions (blue). Generated from src/dw/11_dw_dimensions.sql and 12_dw_facts.sql.&lt;br&gt;+ primary key, # foreign key, - attribute. Multiplicity: each fact row references exactly 1 row of a dimension; a dimension row is referenced by 0..* fact rows. «Role» names a role-playing dimension (DimDate is used several times by the same fact)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="0" width="2300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
