<mxCell id="star1-t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Star schema - dw.FactViewingSession&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each line joins a foreign key of the fact to the primary key of a dimension. A dimension used in several roles (role-playing) is drawn once per role. Dimensions show their keys, natural key and SCD columns only - full definitions are on the constellation page." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="0" width="1700" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
